WEBVTT

00:00:00.918 --> 00:00:04.425
Read English articles bilingually without leaving the original page.

00:00:05.292 --> 00:00:08.743
When I read in English, I don't want to jump to a separate translation page.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:12.427
Choose Bilingual + Smart to translate only the content you're reading.

00:00:13.605 --> 00:00:17.731
Translations appear right after the original while the page layout stays intact.

00:00:20.085 --> 00:00:24.275
The article becomes bilingual, while navigation and sidebars stay mostly unchanged.

00:00:27.996 --> 00:00:30.600
OnlyTranslate brings bilingual reading to web pages, video subtitles, and ebooks.
